    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a value which can be a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_register" kindref="compound">Register</ref> or a constant. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is useful in situations where an instruction may have an interesting register operand or interesting constant operand. For a concrete example, <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="namespacellvm_1a387427d56330771ba6f190e27776a327" kindref="member">getVectorSplat</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
